  "body": "Refs #620. Direct-PR: steward ledger batch\n\nThis batch writes the ledger entries of #640 (LOT-118) into the docs: one changelog row and the new row GAP-209. It touches only the two ledger files, so no macOS jobs run.\n\nBefore folding, the steward changed one line in #640's body: `Section: Settings` became `Section: Settings and appearance`, which is the GAP section's real name.\n\n**Mechanical check:**\n1. Check out the base `d1c7b746200af3cedbbe4835a5bc7e05fa5c24d9`.\n2. Run `python3 tooling/docs/ledger.py fold --apply --prs 640`.\n3. Run `git diff --exit-code <head>`. The diff must be empty.\n\n**After the merge:** run `ledger.py done 640 --apply`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CJ4JPCeiaUyzcb2HYv)_\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated the legacy changelog to document blacklist and whitelist settings, hiding blacklisted usernames, and member-menu and profile commands.\n  * Updated the migration report to include a gap related to pseudo lists after a profile toggle and revised its classification totals.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
