   "body": "<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/message-square-off-dark.svg\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/message-square-off.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Additional comments: 1</summary><blockquote>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>docs/migration/GAP-LEGACY-VS-SWIFT.md-174-174: 1</summary><blockquote>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n`174-174`: **<picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/amber-16.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Minor** · **Functional Correctness** · **Quick win**\n\n<picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-warning.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> **Unverified finding**\nVerification ran but could not confirm this finding. It is shown for review, not as a verified issue.\n\n**Update the LOT-118 classification.**\n\nGAP-209 adds a class `b` change to LOT-118, but Line 329 still lists LOT-118 as an `(a) port`. This misclassifies the lot as a pure port in the convergence plan. Record LOT-118 as mixed and update the lot counts.\n\nAs per coding guidelines, “an edit that is not a row goes in a `ledger-note` block.” Use the reviewed steward workflow for that table.\n\n_Source: Coding guidelines_\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</blockquote></details>\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</blockquote></details>\n\n<h6>\n<details>\n<summary><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/info.svg\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Review info</summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" src